Z||000016||Ronnie||09-11-2001||05:38 PM||||Blo0, we have stayed at Bradley's Campground , many times. It's right there in downtown Cherokee. Nothing fancy, but cheap! <BR>Just a little Mom&Pop type campground. It's on the side street that runs parallel with 441 going thru town , only on the opposite side of the river.<BR>Hope to see you there!!||||reg||6
